<p class="teletype">Please answer the following question honestly:</p>

<p><img src="https://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/scp-4211/cipher5.png" style="height: 20em; border: 1px solid black;"></p>

<p class="teletype">DO YOU REMEMBER WHAT SHE DID?</p>

